+    # Settings for Sentry on the frontend (React). Passed to the browser at runtime by ConfigHelper.sentryWebConfigJson.
+    # We do it this way because npm_run_bundle is run when the WAR is generated via CI/CD. The WAR is per release, not
+    # per environment, so we don't have the per-host configuration at that time. Once we split the frontend from the
